  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support for priority-setting in Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FCDO will fund Africa CDC&apos;s  Health Economics and Financing team to strengthen the health financing decision-making in African Union Member States by (1) strengthening  evidence-informed priority setting for health frameworks (2) improving alignment between health planning and public finance management processes (3) strengthen the tools and institutions to enable effective participation in fiscal dialogues - all contributing
 to strengthening domestic resource mobilisation and building sustainable health systems.</narrative>
  </description>
